---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';

const contactEmail = 'hello@m8tcha.com';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Careers at M8tcha"
  description="Join M8tcha in building more human ways for people to connect."
  sectionLabel="Company"
>
  <p>
    We are building a product for people who want more meaningful ways to meet, talk, and spend time
    together. Our work sits at the intersection of community, technology, and real-world connection.
  </p>

  <h2>Work With Us</h2>
  <p>
    We are growing thoughtfully and may not always have a formal opening listed. If you care about
    trust, product craft, community, or the future of social connection, send a short introduction
    and relevant work to{' '}<a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>{' '}with “Careers” in the
    subject line.
  </p>

  <h2>What Matters Here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Build for people, not engagement for its own sake.</li>
    <li>Make thoughtful decisions and communicate clearly.</li>
    <li>Treat safety, privacy, and belonging as product foundations.</li>
    <li>Stay curious, practical, and close to the people using the product.</li>
  </ul>
</LegalPage>
